<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-158.3-specialized-costing-project-service-intercompany-and-cost-governance" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W4665" name="W4665. Project / Job Costing for B2B &amp; Government Contracts" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Project/contract award (VS-11/VS-46); project cost transaction; project close-out
Frequency: Per project (lifecycle)
Volume: ~ Active B2B/G2G projects (VS-11.2/VS-46.2); ~30% trade + 10% corporate revenue
Owner: Cost Accounting Manager / Project Controller
Participants: Trade/Government sales (VS-11/VS-46), Project Finance (VS-11.2), Procurement (VS-03), Controller
Source: workflow W4665 — Project / Job Costing for B2B &amp; Government Contracts</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4665_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4665_Lane1" name="Project Controller">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4665_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4665_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4665_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4665_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4665_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4665_Start3" name="Project/contract award (VS-11/VS-46); project cost transaction; project close-out">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4665_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4665_Task4" name="Set up the project/job cost structure (WBS): material by delivery stage, direct…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Set up the project/job cost structure (WBS): material by delivery stage, direct labor, subcontractor, equipment rental, freight to site, project overhead; define the cost-collection method (actual) and the revenue-matching method (W4632)
Responsible (R): Project Controller / Cost Accounting
Accountable (A): Controller / Trade Sales Mgr
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4665_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4665_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4665_Task5" name="Collect actual project cost (material issues, AP invoices, timesheets…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Collect actual project cost (material issues, AP invoices, timesheets, subcontractor bills, freight) to the project WBS; monitor actual-vs-budget margin (VS-11.2 W918) and flag margin erosion
Responsible (R): Project Controller / Cost Accounting / AP
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per project lifecycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4665_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4665_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4665_Task6" name="At project close-out (VS-11.2 W793), compute final project cost and margin…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: At project close-out (VS-11.2 W793), compute final project cost and margin, reconcile to revenue recognized (W4632), and feed lessons-learned into future bid costing (VS-11.2 W162)
Responsible (R): Project Controller / Cost Accounting
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per close-out</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4665_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4665_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4665_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4665_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4665_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-115 (ensure cost-master &amp; COGS reconciliation control.) | - CTL-706: project cost collected to WBS; actual-vs-budget monitored weekly; final margin reconciled to revenue at close-out
Owner: Cost Accounting Manager / Project Controller</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4665_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4665_Annotation8" targetRef="W4665_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4665_Flow10" sourceRef="W4665_Start3" targetRef="W4665_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4665_Flow11" sourceRef="W4665_Task4" targetRef="W4665_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4665_Flow12" sourceRef="W4665_Task5" targetRef="W4665_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4665_Flow13" sourceRef="W4665_Task6" targetRef="W4665_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W4665_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W4665_plane" bpmnElement="W_W4665">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4665_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W4665_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
