    <bpmn:process id="W_W4668" name="W4668. Consignment &amp; VMI Cost-Basis &amp; Margin-on-Sell-Through" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Consignment/VMI sell-through (VS-45); monthly settlement
Frequency: Per sell-through + monthly
Volume: ~300 VMI/consignment SKUs from 12 vendors
Owner: Cost Accounting Manager
Participants: Merchandising (VS-45), Vendor Mgmt (VS-03), Controller, Revenue Accounting (VS-157)
Source: workflow W4668 — Consignment &amp; VMI Cost-Basis &amp; Margin-on-Sell-Through</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4668_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4668_Lane1" name="Cost Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4668_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4668_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4668_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4668_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4668_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4668_Start3" name="Consignment/VMI sell-through (VS-45); monthly settlement">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4668_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4668_Task4" name="Establish the consignment/VMI cost basis (vendor settlement price at…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Establish the consignment/VMI cost basis (vendor settlement price at sell-through, not at receipt — goods are vendor-owned per VS-45.1); confirm BuildRight as principal (gross) for the consumer sale (W4628)
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / Merchandising
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per setup</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4668_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4668_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4668_Task5" name="At each sell-through (W543), post COGS at the consignment cost basis and the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: At each sell-through (W543), post COGS at the consignment cost basis and the AP/vendor-payable at settlement; recognize revenue per W4629
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / AP
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per sell-through</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4668_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4668_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4668_Task6" name="Compute consignment/VMI margin (sell-through price − cost basis) by SKU/vendor…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Compute consignment/VMI margin (sell-through price − cost basis) by SKU/vendor; reconcile to the vendor settlement (VS-45.3); monitor commission/fee-type consignment where BuildRight is agent (net)
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4668_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4668_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4668_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4668_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4668_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-706 (ensure controlled execution — Specialized Costing (Project, Service, Intercompany) &amp; Cost Governance (PA-158.3).) | - CTL-706: consignment cost at sell-through (not receipt); principal/agent posture documented; reconciled to settlement monthly
Owner: Cost Accounting Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
