        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4670_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4670_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4670_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4670_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4670_Start3" name="Cost-master change request; audit finding; governance review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4670_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4670_Task4" name="Govern cost-master data (cost elements, conversion factors, allocation bases…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Govern cost-master data (cost elements, conversion factors, allocation bases, overhead rates, kit/BOM) through the master-data governance process (VS-29): request, validate, approve, post, audit-trail
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / Master Data
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4670_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4670_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4670_Task5" name="Apply the cost-change approval matrix: standard-cost change tiered approval…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Apply the cost-change approval matrix: standard-cost change tiered approval (Category Mgr → Controller → CFO by materiality); segregate those who request a cost change from those who approve and post
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / Controller
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4670_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4670_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4670_Task6" name="Review cost-master data quality quarterly (completeness, accuracy, timeliness)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Review cost-master data quality quarterly (completeness, accuracy, timeliness); remediate data-quality issues and feed into the data-quality scorecard (VS-29 W291)
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / Master Data
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4670_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4670_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4670_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4670_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4670_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-115 (ensure cost-master &amp; COGS reconciliation control.) | - CTL-706: cost-master changes via governance with tiered approval and SoD; data-quality reviewed quarterly
Owner: Cost Accounting Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
