      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: ERP costing config change; new cost policy; audit remediation
Frequency: Per change + periodic review
Volume: 1 costing-system config landscape
Owner: Cost Accounting Manager / IT Finance Lead
Participants: IT (VS-27), EA (VS-113), Controller, Master Data (VS-29)
Source: workflow W4671 — Costing System Configuration: Cost-Sheet, Overhead Rates &amp; GL Integration</bpmn:documentation>
