      <bpmn:userTask id="W4671_Task6" name="Configure and maintain the costing system: cost-sheet template per item class…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Configure and maintain the costing system: cost-sheet template per item class, overhead-absorption rates, allocation bases/engines, variance accounts, and GL integration (cost-to-GL mapping per entity)
Responsible (R): IT Finance Lead / Cost Accounting
Accountable (A): CIO / Controller
Duration: Per setup/change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4671_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4671_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
