        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Govern config changes through change-control (VS-27.1): test in non-prod, document, Controller sign-off, deploy; maintain a config-to-policy traceability matrix
Responsible (R): IT / Cost Accounting
Accountable (A): CIO / Controller
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4671_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4671_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4671_Task8" name="Periodically review config for drift from documented cost policy (stale…">
