Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / IT
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Semi-annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4671_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4671_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
