    <bpmn:process id="W_W4672" name="W4672. Cost-Accounting Internal Controls, Variance-Threshold &amp; SoD Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Risk assessment; audit; control remediation; annual review
Frequency: Continuous + annual review
Volume: 1 cost-accounting control set across 5 entities
Owner: Cost Accounting Manager / Controller
Participants: Internal Audit (VS-21), Revenue Assurance (VS-118), IT Security (VS-27.3), Controller
Source: workflow W4672 — Cost-Accounting Internal Controls, Variance-Threshold &amp; SoD Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4672_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4672_Lane1" name="Cost Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4672_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4672_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4672_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4672_Lane2" name="Controller">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4672_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4672_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4672_Start4" name="Risk assessment; audit; control remediation; annual review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4672_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4672_Task5" name="Maintain the cost-accounting control set: preventive (cost-change approval…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain the cost-accounting control set: preventive (cost-change approval matrix W4670, config sign-off W4671, cost-at-sell-through rule W4668) and detective (variance-threshold investigation W4657/W4658/W4659, COGS reconcile W4663, NRV review W4660); map to the internal-controls matrix
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / Internal Audit
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Annual + continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4672_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4672_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4672_Task6" name="Enforce segregation of duties: those who set standard cost, those who post cost…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Enforce segregation of duties: those who set standard cost, those who post cost journals, and those who reconcile/variance-investigate are separate; restrict manual cost-adjustment authority
Responsible (R): Controller / IT Security
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4672_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4672_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4672_Task7" name="Preserve the cost-change and variance audit trail for 10 years (BIR/audit)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Preserve the cost-change and variance audit trail for 10 years (BIR/audit); coordinate with Revenue Assurance (VS-118) on margin-leakage investigation spanning cost and revenue
Responsible (R): Cost Accounting / Internal Audit
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4672_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4672_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4672_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4672_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4672_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-115 (ensure cost-master &amp; COGS reconciliation control.) | - CTL-706: documented control set mapped to internal-controls matrix; SoD enforced; audit trail retained 10 years; controls reviewed annually
Owner: Cost Accounting Manager / Controller</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
